#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:1
msgid "Reloop Mixage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:3
msgid ""
"The Reloop Mixage line of controllers contains 2-channel DJ controller. It "
"offers two jog wheels, line faders, a cross-fader, controls for looping, "
"effects, equalizers and gain controls. The Interface Edition version comes "
"with an integrated soundcard, headphone connection and microphone input and "
"exists in version MK1 (unmarked) and MK2 (marked on back of device)."
msgstr ""

