#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:14
msgid "Audio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:16
msgid ""
"This controller is a MIDI and audio class compliant device so it is "
"compatible as-is with Linux, MacOS and Windows. On Windows, the manufacturer"
" ships an {term}`ASIO` low-latency driver that can be found on the "
"[manufacturer’s product page](https://www.reloop.com/reloop-mixage-ie)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:18
msgid ""
"The microphone {hwlabel}`🎤` input can be set to different modes. To make it "
"usable in Mixxx, set it to **SW**. The {hwlabel}`MASTER` and "
"{hwlabel}`PHONES` level controls work directly on the audio hardware and "
"can't be mapped in Mixxx."
msgstr ""

