msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:169
msgid ""
"When a beatloop has been set, press {hwlabel}`SHIFT` + {hwlabel}`-LENGTH+` /"
" {hwlabel}`BEATMOVE` to enable beatloop adjust mode. The {hwlabel}`LOOP` / "
"{hwlabel}`IN` and {hwlabel}`RELOOP` / {hwlabel}`OUT` buttons will blink. Now"
" you can:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:171
msgid ""
"Move the entire loop using the jog wheel, adjustment is three times as fast "
"while the top of the jog wheel is touched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:172
msgid ""
"Press {hwlabel}`LOOP` / {hwlabel}`IN` to shift the loop in point using the "
"jog wheel. The {hwlabel}`LOOP` / {hwlabel}`IN` will blink."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:173
msgid ""
"Press {hwlabel}`RELOOP` / {hwlabel}`OUT` to shift the loop out point using "
"the jog wheel. The {hwlabel}`RELOOP` / {hwlabel}`OUT` will blink."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:175
msgid ""
"Hold {hwlabel}`SHIFT` and press {hwlabel}`-LENGTH+` / {hwlabel}`BEATMOVE`, "
"or press {hwlabel}`🔍` or {hwlabel}`💿` button to leave beatloop adjust mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:177
msgid "User-adjustable script settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:179
msgid ""
"The `Reloop-Mixage.scripts.js` controller script provides the following "
"settings:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:181
msgid ""
"_scratchByWheelTouch_ (default `false`): change to `true` to get a more "
"regular, turntable-like mode, i.e. scratch by touching the jog wheel instead"
" of having to toggle the disc button. Note that the jog wheels are not very "
"sensitive to touch though (sensitivity can be adjusted on the back of the "
"controller in the MK1 version)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:182
msgid ""
"_scratchTicksPerRevolution_ (default `620`): Change this to adjust the "
"scratch speed. Smaller values mean \"faster\", higher mean \"slower\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:183
msgid ""
"_jogWheelScrollSpeed_ (default `1.0`): Adjust this to change the jog wheel "
"scroll speed. The higher the values, the faster."
msgstr ""

