msgid ""
"Right {hwlabel}`SHIFT` to display the firmware version on the four deck "
"play/cue buttons. The number is display in little-endian binary, e.g 0101 "
"meaning 5."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:190
msgid ""
"Right {hwlabel}`⏯` to show jog wheel touch values. This can be used to "
"adjust sensitivity on the MK1 version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../hardware/controllers/reloop_mixage.md:191
msgid ""
"Left {hwlabel}`⯈⯇` to light up all LEDs. Can be helpful when repairing the "
"controller or replacing the LEDs."
msgstr ""

